There's also some "whassup" graffiti on one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:25.600
stalls in the school bathroom, a reference to the&nbsp;
Budweiser ad campaign that ran from 1999 to 2002&nbsp;&nbsp;

