Whassup!
&nbsp;

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:31.040
Whassup!
And Meilin's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:35.600
flute case has some stickers referencing trends&nbsp;
from around the turn of the millennium such as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:42.080
