Like 4*Town, NSYNC's name also&nbsp;
includes an unspoken asterisk.
&nbsp;

00:07:57.520 --> 00:08:02.320
The all-white outfits worn by 4*Town during&nbsp;
their concert tour channel the cover of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:07.280
